CM_ BO_ 1110 "SCM_Raw_Status";
CM_ SG_ 1110 OP_WISW_SZL_LIN "Wiper Status Signal (Right Stalk)
Bit 0~1 : Switch status on Automatic wiping, Wiper step 1, Wiper step 2 switch status
Bit 2: Not used.(this bit is always 0.)
Bit 3: Front mist switch status
Bit 4: Front washer switch status
Bit 5: Not used.(this bit is always 0.)
Bit 6: Rear wiping switch status
Bit 7: Rear washing switch status
* 1111 1111: Signal Invalid
";
CM_ SG_ 1110 COMM_ERR_SZL_LIN "This signal showes if there is or was a communication error.";
CM_ SG_ 1110 BCM_Wiper_Front_Status "Front Wiper Motor Feedback of status";
CM_ SG_ 1110 OP_WIPO_SZL_LIN "Wiper Step (Right Stalk)
0x0: Step 1
0x1: Step 2
0x2: Step 3
0x4: Step 4
0x7: signal invalid
";
CM_ SG_ 1110 OP_COLS_SZL_LIN "Left Stalk Lever Signal (Light function)
*the status of each bit follows this: (0: Off, 1: ON)
Bit 0: Highway flashing right indicator status
Bit 1: Flashing right indicator status
Bit 2: Highway flashing left indicator status
Bit 3: Flashing left indicator status
Bit 4: High-beam light status
Bit 5: High-beam light flashing status
Bit 6: Reserved
Bit 7: Not used.(this value is always ?0?)
* 1111 1111: Signal Invalid";
CM_ SG_ 1110 NOD_ERR_SZL_LIN "If SCM detects any error (any error status occurred), SCM sends this signal as ?error active?.";
